# Hero in Training: "When this creature enters, draw a card. If you control another Hero, you gain 2 life." Bot2's Hero (T2) is
# alone on its side and gains Bot2 nothing; it does not count for Bot1 ("you control", T3: Bot1's first Hero gains nothing); Bot1's
# second Hero (T5) sees the first as "another" (the Hero entering does not count itself) and gains 2. Each draws a card.

